 ## Background
-The SOG Volume Reader originates from Tao Ju's dual contouring library for implicit modeling and surface reconstruction [S1, S2, unofficial]. It was developed to support the loading of volumetric data specifically formatted for hierarchical octree-based processing [S1, S2, unofficial]. The format and reader are associated with Tao Ju's work on dual contouring and intersection-free surface reconstruction [S1, S2, unofficial].
